    "### Way 7: Hierarchical chunking\n",
    "\n",
    "**Concept:** keep a **tree**: a big **parent** (the section) and small **children** (the paragraphs). We search with the small children (sharp match). When a child matches, we send its **parent** to the LLM (more context).\n",
    "\n",
    "```\n",
    "parent: \"Leave Policy\" (whole section)\n",
    "   ├─ child: \"Every employee gets 20 days...\"\n",
    "   ├─ child: \"To take leave, send a request...\"\n",
    "   └─ child: \"Sick leave is separate...\"\n",
    "```\n",
    "\n",
    "**Good:** sharp search and full context. **Bad:** we must keep the link between parent and child.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Use it for:** contracts, financial reports, technical specifications."
   ]
  },
