    "### Key takeaways\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Load** files with `Path(...).glob(\"*.txt\")` and `read_text()`. Keep the file name as the **source**.\n",
    "- **Chunk** = a small part of a document. Goal: **one idea per chunk**.\n",
    "- Too big = a blurry vector and many tokens. Too small = the meaning is lost.\n",
    "- The ways: **fixed-size, sliding window, sentence, paragraph, recursive, semantic, hierarchical, contextual, topic-based, modality-specific, AI-driven, agentic**.\n",
    "- Pick by the document: clear parts → paragraph or recursive. No parts → sliding window. Accuracy first → semantic. Tables → modality-specific.\n",
    "- Start simple (**recursive** or **paragraph**), then **test with real questions**.\n",
    "- Every chunk keeps an `id`, a `source` and its `text`. **Always look at your chunks.**"
